@VenuePulse.Ticketing.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

### Catálogo de eventos
GET {{VenuePulse.Ticketing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events
Accept: application/json

### Tipos de entrada de un evento
GET {{VenuePulse.Ticketing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/ticket-types
Accept: application/json

### Alta de evento (Operaciones)
POST {{VenuePulse.Ticketing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Derbi de la ciudad",
  "startsAtUtc": "2026-09-01T20:00:00Z",
  "type": "Match",
  "relevance": "Special"
}

### Cerrar venta de un evento
POST {{VenuePulse.Ticketing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/close-sales

### Cancelar un evento
POST {{VenuePulse.Ticketing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/cancel

###
